    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"可颂\"]  嗯嗯，原来如此，所以我们现在是要去找那个叫祖玛玛的人要回引擎对吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可颂",
        "content": "嗯嗯，原来如此，所以我们现在是要去找那个叫祖玛玛的人要回引擎对吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"char_201_moeshd\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  没错。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "没错。"
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  诶？祭典就这么结束了吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "诶？祭典就这么结束了吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  是啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "是啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  那我不是白来了吗！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "那我不是白来了吗！"
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  算了，反正听起来就是那种我不会很感兴趣的东西。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "算了，反正听起来就是那种我不会很感兴趣的东西。"
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  比起这个，嘉维尔，说好的这里适合度假呢！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "比起这个，嘉维尔，说好的这里适合度假呢！"
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  啊？你不觉得这里环境很好吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "啊？你不觉得这里环境很好吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  虽然，确实，是这样，没错！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "虽然，确实，是这样，没错！"
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  但是，这里一点也没有度假的要素啊！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "但是，这里一点也没有度假的要素啊！"
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#2\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  度假的要素是什么样的啊？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "度假的要素是什么样的啊？"
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#2\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  当然是，海边，沙滩，阳伞，冰淇淋啊！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "当然是，海边，沙滩，阳伞，冰淇淋啊！"
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  为了这个，我还特地准备了新的泳装，而且出发前就穿在衣服下面了！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "为了这个，我还特地准备了新的泳装，而且出发前就穿在衣服下面了！"
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_337_utage_1\", name2=\"char_201_moeshd\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[name=\"可颂\"]  诶，我倒是单纯地没有什么事做就跟来看看了......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可颂",
        "content": "诶，我倒是单纯地没有什么事做就跟来看看了......"
    },
