        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#2\", name2=\"char_201_moeshd#3\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  呃，我一开始就没说过有这种东西吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "呃，我一开始就没说过有这种东西吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#2\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  你不是说可以玩水的吗！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "你不是说可以玩水的吗！"
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  那确实有啊，雨林深处有一座大瀑布，我们可以在那里玩水。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "那确实有啊，雨林深处有一座大瀑布，我们可以在那里玩水。"
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  而且为了去祖玛玛的部族，我们肯定要经过大瀑布。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "而且为了去祖玛玛的部族，我们肯定要经过大瀑布。"
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  别说你，我也带了泳装呢，只不过我没拿出来而已。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "别说你，我也带了泳装呢，只不过我没拿出来而已。"
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_337_utage_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  真的吗，好耶！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "真的吗，好耶！"
    },
