    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  看起来人找到了啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "看起来人找到了啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  多亏了你啊，依娜姆，谢了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "多亏了你啊，依娜姆，谢了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  小事。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "小事。"
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  哦对了，特米米那孩子呢，不是应该跟你们在一起吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "哦对了，特米米那孩子呢，不是应该跟你们在一起吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  不知道，她好像有自己的事，之后会跟她汇合吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "不知道，她好像有自己的事，之后会跟她汇合吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  好吧，那麻烦你们把这些书带给她。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "好吧，那麻烦你们把这些书带给她。"
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  让我看看，《都市丽人》，《100天教你如何学会企业管理》，《如何成为一个时尚专家》......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "让我看看，《都市丽人》，《100天教你如何学会企业管理》，《如何成为一个时尚专家》......"
    },
    {
        "id": 149,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 150,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=0.3, xstrength=10, ystrength=12, vibrato=30, randomness=90, fadeout=true, block=true)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "0.3,",
        "xstrength": "10,",
        "ystrength": "12,",
        "vibrato": "30,",
        "randomness": "90,",
        "fadeout": "true,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"嘉维尔\"]  这都什么奇奇怪怪的书啊！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "嘉维尔",
        "content": "这都什么奇奇怪怪的书啊！"
    },
    {
        "id": 152,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 153,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  她就是靠这些书学的萨尔贡语和对外界的知识的，啊，当然基础是我教她的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "她就是靠这些书学的萨尔贡语和对外界的知识的，啊，当然基础是我教她的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 154,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_337_utage_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 155,
        "raw": "[name=\"宴\"]  唔，靠这些学会萨尔贡语应该很难吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "宴",
        "content": "唔，靠这些学会萨尔贡语应该很难吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 156,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_337_utage_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 157,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  是啊。但她就是这么学下来了，一个字一个字，一个词一个词。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "是啊。但她就是这么学下来了，一个字一个字，一个词一个词。"
    },
    {
        "id": 158,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  其实，比起学习的艰难，一开始她那种不知道自己该怎么做而焦急的样子才让人看着都难受。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "其实，比起学习的艰难，一开始她那种不知道自己该怎么做而焦急的样子才让人看着都难受。"
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  我也是因为这个才决定教她萨尔贡语的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "我也是因为这个才决定教她萨尔贡语的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_075\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[name=\"依娜姆\"]  嘉维尔，她为了追上你，可是非常努力的啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "依娜姆",
        "content": "嘉维尔，她为了追上你，可是非常努力的啊。"
